# score: Bowed swell
# summary: 3 bars / 1 guitar, 1 bow / ~0.4 min — a slow swell on a bowed D3: crescendo on the down-bow, diminuendo on the up-bow
# tempo: 30    time: 4/4    key: D    bars: 3
# master: rms=-16
# tab: standard

# text @b1: down-bow, the speed rising from 0.2 to 1.0 over eight seconds (force follows); the note swells
# text @b2: up-bow, the speed falling from 1.0 back to 0.2; the hair lifts and lands in 10 ms between bows
# text @b3: the bow lifts; the world rings down

# instruments:
#   gt   = steel-string guitar (treble, -12, anatomy=steel-string-v0, tuning=E2 A2 D3 G3 B3 E4, capo=0)
#   gt.b = bow (treble, pos=0.12)

bar 1: gt.b=D3w@4:0[arco,speed=0.2->1.0]
bar 2: gt.b=D3w@4:0[upbow,speed=1.0->0.2]
bar 3: gt.b=Rw
